    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þæt grið, þæt se ealdormann ⁊ kinges geréfa in Fif burga geþincða sylle, bete man þæt mid XII hund'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But for breach of the peace which the ealdorman or the king's reeve establishes in the court of the Five Boroughs, 1200 [of silver] shall be paid as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et pax, quam aldremannus uel prepositus regis in Quinque burgorum geþincða dabit, emendetur XII hund'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
